<img class="banner-image" src='{{bannerImg | toAbsoluteUrl}}'>
<div class="article-section">
    William's Embrace is a Swansea-based charity, creating free, bespoke memorial hand and foot castings for families experiencing baby loss. 
    I had my first meeting with their founder, Danika, on the 23rd of June, 2026. During my time as a volunteer, I wrote copy for their web pages, 
    redesigned the look of their Squarespace site, and created bespoke graphics for them to use across their site and social media pages.
</div>
<div class="btn row">
    <a class="btn primary" href="{{'#TODO' | toAbsoluteUrl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit William's Embrace<i class="ri-arrow-right-s-fill"></i></a>
