<h2 id="web-design">Web Design</h2>
<div class="article-section">
    I created a selection of wireframes in Figma to present to Danika so that she could approve them for the redesign. 
    The images below depict the "About" page at different stages in the redesign process.  
    Simple navigation and clean layouts were prioritised, as the site was designed to be navigated by families in distress. 
    The goal was to inform, not to overwhelm.  
    Note the sketches for illustrated graphics in the wireframe iteration.
