<h2 id="copywriting">Copywriting</h2>
<div class="article-section">
    For this project, I drew on similar experiences I had writing for <a href="{{'#TODO' | toAbsoluteUrl}}">Adenydd</a>, to create copy that was warm, without being patronising. 
    William's Embrace works in a highly sensitive area, so I wanted to ensure that those viewing the site felt they were being treated with the appropriate respect and sensitivity. 
    I followed the supportive, compassionate tone that Danika had initially laid out, so that visitors would know that this charity was founded by someone who has lived through the experience of baby loss and doing this work from a genuine place of understanding and a desire to help other's going through the same. 
    #TODO: QUOTE - SITE OPENING
    I also tried to keep key information clear without compromising that warmth, ensuring that the fact that these services were <b>free</b> was emphasises whenever possible to do so. 
    Other key information on the site was placed on it's own line, usually in a larger font size, to make it extra clear to visitors.
