<h2 id="maintenance">Maintenance</h2>
<div class="article-section">
    <ul class="list-bullet">
        <li>
            I migrated information from the original "News" page into blog posts that would automatically change and display 
            as they were written, making the page easier to update with new events or posts by Danika or another, future volunteer.
        </li>
        <li>
            I gathered images from William's Embrace's multiple social media channels to flesh out the visual content for the site. 
            This resulted in the final web pages looking a lot more tied to the organisation and their branding.
